hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1115","Harun bin Ishaq Al-Hamdani told us, Abu Khalid told us, Uthman bin Hakim told us, on the authority of Ibn Yassar, who is Saeed bin Yassar, On the authority of Ibn Abbas, he said: “Most of what the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to recite in the two rak’ahs of Fajr: Say, ‘We believe in God and in what has been revealed. to us and what was revealed to Abraham, to the end of the verse, and in the end, say, “O People of the Book, come to a common word between us and you.” His saying: Bear witness that we are Muslims, Surah Al Imran, verse 64"
